        PatientSupportAngle (float): A copy of the patient support angle at this control point, in degrees, in the range [0, 360[. It is defined as the orientation of the IEC PATIENT SUPPORT (turntable) coordinate system with respect to the IEC FIXED REFERENCE coordinate system (in degrees).
        TableTopLateralPosition (float): Table top lateral position in millimeters, in the IEC TABLE TOP coordinate system.
        TableTopLongitudinalPosition (float): Table top longitudinal position in millimeters, in the IEC TABLE TOP coordinate system.
        TableTopVerticalPosition (float): Table top vertical position in millimeters, in the IEC TABLE TOP coordinate system.
        GantryAngle (float): A copy of the gantry angle at this control point, in degrees, in the range [0, 360[. It is defined as the orientation of the IEC GANTRY coordinate system with respect to the IEC FIXED REFERENCE coordinate system (in degrees).
        MetersetWeight (float): A copy of the cumulative meterset weight to this control point.
        CollimatorAngle (float): A copy of the collimator angle at this control point, in degrees, in the range [0, 360[. It is defined as the orientation of the IEC BEAM LIMITING DEVICE coordinate system with respect to the IEC GANTRY coordinate system (in degrees).
