        Name (str): [Availability of this property depends on your Eclipse Scripting API license] The name of the Plan.
        Comment (str): [Availability of this property depends on your Eclipse Scripting API license] A comment about the Plan.
        PlanNormalizationValue (float): [Availability of this property depends on your Eclipse Scripting API license] The plan normalization value in percentage. The plan is normalized according to the plan normalization value, for instance, 200%. The value is Double.NaN if it is not defined.
        PlanUncertainties (List[PlanUncertainty]): Plan uncertainties defined for the plan.
        PlanObjectiveStructures (List[str]): The list of structure IDs that are present in the plan objectives (prescriptions and indices).
        ApprovalHistory (List[ApprovalHistoryEntry]): Returns the approval history of the plan setup.
        DosePerFractionInPrimaryRefPoint (DoseValue): The calculated fraction dose in the primary reference point.
        PrescribedDosePerFraction (DoseValue): The prescribed fraction dose.
        PrescribedPercentage (float): The prescribed dose percentage as a decimal number. For example, if the prescribed dose percentage shown in the Eclipse user interface is 80 %, returns 0.8
        TotalPrescribedDose (DoseValue): The total prescribed dose.
        ApplicationScriptLogs (List[ApplicationScriptLog]): The log entries of the script executions that have modified the plan.
        ApprovalStatus (PlanSetupApprovalStatus): The approval status.
        ApprovalStatusAsString (str): Returns the approval status as a string (localized).
